    <section class="oop-section">
        <h2 class="oop-section-title">Concept Overview</h2>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem;">
            <li><strong>Inheritance</strong>: Creating specialised versions (`class Brute(Player)`) of a base class.</li>
            <li><strong>Super</strong>: Calling the parent constructor (`super().__init__`) to set up basic stats before customising.</li>
            <li><strong>Polymorphism (Preview)</strong>: Treating Butes and Scouts as "Players".</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="oop-section">
        <h2 class="oop-section-title">Common Misconceptions</h2>
        <div class="info-content">
            <p><strong>1. Forgetting `super().__init__(name)`</strong></p>
            <p>If they don't call super, `self.name` and other base stats won't be set, causing crashes. It's crucial to "build the parent first".</p>
            
            <p><strong>2. Redefining methods unnecessarily</strong></p>
            <p>Students might copy-paste `take_damage` into Brute. Explain that they <em>inherit</em> it for free!</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="oop-section">
        <h2 class="oop-section-title">Solution Code</h2>
        <div class="code-block" style="background: #1e1e1e; color: #d4d4d4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; overflow-x: auto;">
            <pre><code>from .player import Player

class Brute(Player):
    """Start with high HP, low accuracy."""
    def __init__(self, name):
        super().__init__(name)  # CRITICAL
        self.health = 120
        self.max_health = 120   # Must match
        self.armour = 3
        self.accuracy = 70

    def describe_specialty(self):
        return "Brute: Tanky but clumsy."


class Scout(Player):
    """Start with low HP, high accuracy."""
    def __init__(self, name):
        super().__init__(name)  # CRITICAL
        self.health = 80
        self.max_health = 80
        self.armour = 1
        self.accuracy = 95

    def describe_specialty(self):
        return "Scout: Agile glass cannon."</code></pre>
